  <FLAVOURTEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="en-US"><![CDATA[The spikes of sangrite made the goblin stronger, but they didn’t make him any smarter.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="fr-FR"><![CDATA[Les fragments de sangrite rendirent le gobelin plus puissant, mais certainement pas plus futé.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="es-ES"><![CDATA[Las astillas de sangrita hicieron al trasgo más fuerte, pero no lo hicieron más listo.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="de-DE"><![CDATA[Die Stacheln aus Sangrit machten den Goblin zwar stärker, leider aber nicht klüger.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="it-IT"><![CDATA[Gli spunzoni di sangrite resero il goblin più forte, ma non aumentarono certo la sua intelligenza.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="jp-JA"><![CDATA[ゴブリンはサングライトのとげで強くはなったが、それで賢くなることはなかった。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ko-KR"><![CDATA[상그라이트의 가시가 그 고블린을 더 강하게 만들었지만, 더 똑똑하게 만들지는 못했다.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ru-RU"><![CDATA[Сангритовые шипы сделали гоблина сильнее, но, увы, ничуть не умнее.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="pt-BR"><![CDATA[As estacas de sangrite tornaram o goblin mais forte, mas não mais inteligente.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-CN"><![CDATA[闪晶的尖刺使这鬼怪变得更强壮，但并未让他变得更聪明。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-HK"><![CDATA[閃晶的尖刺使這鬼怪變得更強壯，但並未讓他變得更聰明。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
  </FLAVOURTEXT>
